","reason":"Defines the standard AES/GCM tag and nonce sizes and a cryptographically secure nonce source shared by encryption operations.","symbol":"EncryptedKey GCM configuration"},{"source_file_path":"mobile/src/main/java/org/fedorahosted/freeotp/encryptor/EncryptedKey.java","original_code":"    public static EncryptedKey encrypt(SecretKey key, SecretKey plaintext)
